    {
      "type": "text", "id": "layer1_txt",
      "x": 715, "y": 172, "width": 290, "height": 110,
      "text": "SolidPolygonLayer  ('climate-heatmap')\n  • iterate lats × lons → cells[]\n  • polygon = 0.21° square around (lat,lon)\n  • fillColor = getColor(variable, val, fixedMin, fixedMax)\n  • beforeId = 'boundary_county'  (under borders)\n  • onHover → setHoverInfo({type:'grid', ...})",
      "originalText": "SolidPolygonLayer  ('climate-heatmap')\n  • iterate lats × lons → cells[]\n  • polygon = 0.21° square around (lat,lon)\n  • fillColor = getColor(variable, val, fixedMin, fixedMax)\n  • beforeId = 'boundary_county'  (under borders)\n  • onHover → setHoverInfo({type:'grid', ...})",
      "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#78350f", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid",
