      "x": 1065, "y": 212, "width": 260, "height": 200,
      "text": "MapboxOverlay  ({ interleaved: true })\n  overlayRef.current.setProps({ layers })\n\n     ↓\n\nMapLibre Map\n  • Positron tiles (CartoDB)\n  • maxBounds [[-26,34],[46,72]]\n  • boundary + label paint tweaks\n  • interleaved deck.gl layers\n\n     ↓\n\n<canvas> in mapContainer div",
